00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:14.130
The link is available in the video description,
read it carefully to make sure you qualify,

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:19.490
and if you apply through the specified e-mail
address, make sure to mention Two Minute Papers

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:20.490
in your message.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:26.300
This is an excellent opportunity to read and
write amazing papers, and work with some of

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:27.830
